(\\frac{3}{2})}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the circle is centered at $(\\frac{1}{2},2)$ and its radius is $\\frac{3}{2}.$" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280090 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280091 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280092 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280093 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1000 #edb/ref 17592186280094 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1041 "selection" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1104 #edb/ref 17592186280092 13194139534168 true] [17592186280089 1110 #uuid "f4b70656-0a53-59cc-b22d-e9002336746b" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280090 1034 "center: $(\\frac{1}{2},-2)$, radius: $\\frac{3}{2}$" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280090 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534168 true] [17592186280090 1111 #uuid "311f8c72-774f-5f89-9a99-beedc9df420e" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280091 1034 "center: $(2,\\frac{1}{2})$, radius: $\\frac{3}{2}$" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280091 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534168 true] [17592186280091 1111 #uuid "0bf4f6a8-750d-5b85-b51e-c42c4d19bbed" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280092 1034 "center: $(\\frac{1}{2},2)$, radius: $\\frac{3}{2}$" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280092 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534168 true] [17592186280092 1111 #uuid "e41410c9-780d-57f1-8375-95a1c4f15f09" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280093 1034 "center: $(-\\frac{1}{2},2)$, radius: $\\frac{3}{2}$" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280093 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534168 true] [17592186280093 1111 #uuid "809bb278-fcd0-5c2d-a7af-ed5bfbab9123" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280094 1034 "center: $(-\\frac{1}{2},-2)$, radius: $\\frac{3}{2}$" 13194139534168 true] [17592186280094 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534168 true] [17592186280094 1111 #uuid "601d553b-93d4-571e-ac52-69bb151590e4" 13194139534168 true]